<div class="container">
  <div class="row">
    <h1>About UMedia</h1>
  </div>
  <hr>

  <div class="row">
    <p>UMedia provides access to digitized collections from across the University of Minnesota. These materials include photographs, archives, audio, video, maps, and more, with new items added on a regular basis. These open and freely available resources support the teaching and research needs of scholars, educators, students, and the public.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-12" id="about-stats">
      <p>Number of collections: <%= collection_count %></p>
      <p>Digitized items: <%= item_count %></p>
      <p>Digitized pages: <%= page_count %></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>